# Experiments

Hypothesis testing, benchmark logs, and technical spikes.
Format adheres to [make-a-change](https://github.com/alexsmedile/make-a-change).

## EXP-001: Experiment Title <!-- ref: exp-001 -->
- **Date**: YYYY-MM-DD
- **Hypothesis**: What we expect to observe or improve.
- **Method**: How the benchmark or spike was tested.
- **Result**: Measured metrics and outcomes.
- **Outcome**: **ADOPTED** | **REJECTED** | **REFINED**
